{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.reeb_operations_per_planck","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.reeb_operations_per_planck","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:QOU.Shared.ArchimedeanEval"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.reeb_operations_per_planck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.reeb_operations_per_planck","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L91-L116","doc":"**Discrete iterations per Reeb circuit** ([`prop:reeb-operations-per-planck`]).\n\n`n_R = t_P = q/(q − 1) = 1/ℏ_q`, the phase increment satisfies\n`0 < ℏ_q < 1`, and each iteration performs one `∇_q` application and\none `R`-matrix evaluation — all *derived* from the substrate\ndefinitions and `q > 1`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:reeb-operations-per-planck","label":"prop:reeb-operations-per-planck","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/reeb-operations-per-planck.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R_matrix_evals_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R_matrix_evals_eq","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L89-L89","doc":"Modelling datum (iii): each iteration evaluates exactly one\n`R`-matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R_matrix_evals","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R_matrix_evals","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L86-L86","doc":"Number of `R`-matrix evaluations per iteration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_connection_apps_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_connection_apps_eq","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L84-L84","doc":"Modelling datum (ii): each iteration applies `∇_q` exactly once. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_connection_apps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_connection_apps","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Number of `∇_q` connection applications per iteration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R_eq_t_P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R_eq_t_P","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L80-L80","doc":"**Definition (Reeb-time coordinate `t = ℏ_q · 𝒯`):** the iteration\ncount composing one circuit equals the Planck time. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.n_R","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L77-L77","doc":"Number of iterations per Reeb circuit `n_R(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.t_P_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.t_P_eq","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L75-L75","doc":"**Definition:** `t_P = q/(q − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.t_P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.t_P","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Planck time `t_P(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.hbar_q_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.hbar_q_eq","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L71-L71","doc":"**Definition:** `ℏ_q = (q − 1)/q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.hbar_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.hbar_q","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Substrate q-Planck constant `ℏ_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.q_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.q_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L67-L67","doc":"`q > 1` (QOU regime).\n\n`q_real` is no longer a field here: it is `ArchimedeanEval.q_real`, i.e.\n`eval q`, so this bound now constrains the image of the inherited\nsubstrate parameter rather than a free real (bean `qou-mt7r`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.toArchimedeanEval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext.toArchimedeanEval","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L61-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ReebOperationsPerPlanckContext","kind":"class","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/reeb_operations_per_planck.lean#L55-L89","doc":"Inputs for the Reeb-operations-per-Planck identity.\n\nThe substrate definitions (`ℏ_q = (q−1)/q`, `t_P = q/(q−1)`,\n`n_R = t_P`) are carried as fields; the arithmetic identities\n`t_P = 1/ℏ_q` and `0 < ℏ_q < 1` are *derived* in the theorem, not\nassumed. The per-iteration operation counts are modelling data. ","signatureChunk":0}]}